the number of single-parent households and two-parent
households in which the single parent or both parents work
is increasing significantly;

the lack of employment policies to accommodate working
parents can force individuals to choose between job security
and parenting;

there is inadequate job security for employees who
have serious health conditions that prevent them from working
for temporary periods;

